s on individual links, not createTRPCClient":[186,204],"#tRPC -- SuperJSON Transformer#Common Mistakes#[CRITICAL] Transformer goes on individual links, not createTRPCClient#{1}":[188,204],"#tRPC -- SuperJSON Transformer#Common Mistakes#[CRITICAL] Transformer on only some terminating links in splitLink":[205,242],"#tRPC -- SuperJSON Transformer#Common Mistakes#[CRITICAL] Transformer on only some terminating links in splitLink#{1}":[207,242],"#tRPC -- SuperJSON Transformer#Common Mistakes#[HIGH] Using transformer on client but not on server":[243,268],"#tRPC -- SuperJSON Transformer#Common Mistakes#[HIGH] Using transformer on client but not on server#{1}":[245,268],"#tRPC -- SuperJSON Transformer#See Also":[269,274],"#tRPC -- SuperJSON Transformer#See Also#{1}":[271,271],"#tRPC -- SuperJSON Transformer#See Also#{2}":[272,272],"#tRPC -- SuperJSON Transformer#See Also#{3}":[273,274]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"name":"superjson","description":"Configure SuperJSON transformer on both server initTRPC.create({ transformer: superjson }) and every client terminating link (httpBatchLink, httpLink, wsLink, httpSubscriptionLink) to support Date, Map, Set, BigInt over the wire. Transformer must match on both sides. In v11, transformer goes on individual links, not the client constructor.\n","type":"composition","library":"trpc","library_version":"11.14.0","requires":["server-setup","client-setup"],"sources":["www/docs/server/data-transformers.md"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[25,27],[31,42],[46,60],[68,93],[99,116],[120,138],[140,145],[155,163],[167,180],[190,199],[209,221],[225,237],[247,253],[257,263]]},